      "node_id": "kg_doc_1",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Letters to Cleo are an alternative rock band from Boston, Massachusetts, best known for the 1994 single, \"Here & Now\", from their full-length debut album, \"Aurora Gory Alice\". The band's members are Kay Hanley, Greg McKenna, Michael Eisenstein, Stacy Jones, Scott Riebling, and later, Tom Polce.",
